--SMTP_HOST= "your_smtp_host (e.g., smtp.mailtrap.io)"
--SMTP_PORT= "your_smtp_port (usually 587, 465 or 2525)"
--SMTP_USER= "your_smtp_user"
--SMTP_PASS= "your_smtp_password"
--DB_PASSWORD= "your_database_password"
--MYSQL_DATABASE= "your_database_name"

Put this message (without the "--") in a file named ".env" and replace the values with your actual configuration.
Make sure to keep this file secure and do not share it publicly, as it contains sensitive information.

